{"786770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Z: The End", "steam_appid": 786770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z: The End is a survival game in a zombie-infested world. Your only goal is to survive.<br><br>The virus escaped containment, and the infected destroyed the world. Scavenge what is left, build a safe house, and find or craft weapons to fight off the zombies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><br>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual Zombie Survival Sandbox that's meant to be easy to pick up and play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player where you can save anytime, with cloud saves supported.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies that are slow but still dangerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find or harvest materials for building and crafting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot, hunt, or grow your own food to stay fed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a house of your own or reinforce an existing one to your liking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A moderately compact map that leaves room for exploration, without taking hours to traverse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day turns to night, and Mother Nature continues to take its course.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather that impacts the world. Rain and thunderstorms make the plants grow faster and reduce your visibility, while fog makes it even harder for the infected to see you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk with the infected by covering your scent with their guts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find notes from survivors to see what happened to them and the world.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z: The End is a survival game in a zombie-infested world. Your only goal is to survive.<br><br>The virus escaped containment, and the infected destroyed the world. S